PROJECT NAME: DRxGuard

PROJECT CATEGORY

AI-Powered Pharmaceutical Intelligence, Medicine Information & Healthcare Assistance Platform.

PROJECT VISION

Build DRxGuard, an advanced, visually stunning, highly interactive pharmaceutical and healthcare application.

The application should combine:

- AI Pharmaceutical Assistant
- Drug Interaction Intelligence
- Medicine Information Database
- Medicine Comparison
- Medicine Identification Scanner
- Pregnancy Support
- Health Calculators
- Laboratory Report Understanding
- Medicine Management
- Smart Notifications
