This should not look like a basic medicine reminder application or a generic hospital management system.

It should look like a premium international medical technology product.

The UI must be extremely professional, modern, futuristic, clean, colourful, visually rich and easy to understand.

Build a complete interactive prototype with functional navigation and working demo interactions.

