29. MEDICAL DATA ACCURACY & SAFETY

This is a healthcare-related application.

Accuracy and patient safety must be prioritised over visual presentation.

Requirements:

1. Use reliable, verified pharmaceutical information.
2. Maintain source attribution.
3. Display information update dates.
4. Distinguish confirmed information from uncertain results.
5. Do not fabricate drug interactions.
6. Do not fabricate medicine compositions.
7. Do not independently prescribe medicines.
8. Do not recommend unsupervised medicine substitutions.
9. Do not diagnose diseases from symptoms or lab reports.
10. Provide emergency guidance for serious warning signs.
11. Protect sensitive health information.
12. Maintain secure access controls.

Every AI-generated medical response must include relevant limitations and professional-care guidance.

